    "image_with_text_overlay_AHzG9E": {
      "type": "image-with-text-overlay",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_RLj6dL": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "UHB Tapes & VHB Tapes",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_7cgJkR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Ultra-high bonding (UHB) tapes and very-high bonding (VHB) tapes are solutions for applications that require powerful adhesion and nearly indestructible bond strength. Both of these products are compatible with a wide range of substrates, including metal and plastic materials, and achieve maximum bond strength 72 hours after application. Whether you’re looking for UHB tapes or VHB tapes, NADCO has a high-performing product that will meet the needs of your application.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_RLj6dL",
        "text_7cgJkR"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.image-with-text-overlay.name",
      "settings": {
        "container": "fixed",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/fee17d6d58e40e62fa3862ad863c04df42417eac.png",
        "desktop_height": "extra-small",
        "overlay_opacity": 50,
        "enable_parallax": false,
        "parallax_direction": "vertical",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "content_position": "middle-center",
